# graphify scan exclusions
#
# OKF v0.2 scaffolding. Every folder carries index.md / log.md / todo.md.
# They are navigation and history, not domain content, and they were producing
# 44% of the graph's nodes while contributing 9% of its cross-content edges.
#
#   index.md - a catalogue of links to documents the graph already contains.
#              Created a duplicate node for every real document
#              ("Warranty Obligation Matrix" vs "Warranty Obligation Matrix Index").
#   log.md   - changelog. Nodes were bare dates; re-extracted on every --update.
#   todo.md  - transient open items, obsolete by design.
index.md
log.md
todo.md

# To keep the root toolkit map while still dropping the 42 per-folder indexes,
# uncomment the next line (negations are last-match-wins, so it must stay below):
#!/index.md
